{"id":119489,"title":"02 | 内容综述","content":"本课程系统讲解 ZooKeeper 从基础应用到源码原理的完整知识体系，共分为六章。前三章夯实基础：第一章涵盖安装配置、核心概念及 CLI 工具使用；第二章深入客户端开发，解析核心 API 并结合实例演示协同服务构建；第三章聚焦生产运维，详解环境部署、参数调优及原生与第三方监控集成方案。后三章拓展高阶应用与底层机制：第四章通过实战项目阐述基于 ZooKeeper 的服务发现实现，并剖析 Apache Kafka 对其依赖机制；第五章引入横向对比，分析 ETCD 和 X-Paxos 等同类系统，拓宽分布式协调技术视野；第六章回归本质，结合经典论文解读架构设计原理，深入核心模块源码并补充相关计算机理论基础。课程内容层层递进，旨在帮助学习者掌握从日常开发运维到深层原理理解的全面技能，构建扎实的分布式系统协调能力。","comments":[{"had_liked":false,"id":125701,"user_name":"钱","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":1009652,"ip_address":"","ucode":"2C92A243A463D4","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/0f/67/f4/9a1feb59.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1566228254,"is_pvip":false,"replies":[{"id":46475,"content":"Chubby是基于Paxos的，etcd是基于Raft的，后面会对比讲解一下。","user_name":"作者回复","user_name_real":"Geek_215586","uid":1591870,"ctime":1566311749,"ip_address":"","comment_id":125701,"utype":1}],"discussion_count":1,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":100034201,"comment_content":"打卡，看内容还不错，所有的分布式数据一致性协议，希望老师能对比讲解一下。","like_count":4,"discussions":[{"author":{"id":1591870,"avatar":"http://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/Q0j4TwGTfTJyDiaaDJrwRsdUia9HxA8EuWaDVLr4E1gMG5y2ZTxV7BNUhdNABCmH3GMZTzib796X5duibiaeuRmNXeg/132","nickname":"Geek_215586","note":"","ucode":"5916AC9CC5FBE2","race_medal":0,"user_type":2,"is_pvip":false},"reply_author":{"id":0,"avatar":"","nickname":"","note":"","ucode":"","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"discussion":{"id":463668,"discussion_content":"Chubby是基于Paxos的，etcd是基于Raft的，后面会对比讲解一下。","content_length":39,"likes_number":0,"is_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"ctime":1566311749,"is_liked":false,"can_delete":false,"is_complain":false,"is_top":true,"parent_id":0,"ip_address":"","group_id":0,"attachments":[]},"score":2,"extra":"{\"reply\":true,\"user_type\":2}","child_discussion_number":0,"child_discussions":[]}]},{"had_liked":false,"id":125620,"user_name":"WL","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":1173771,"ip_address":"","u